error: this element writes `display` in its own `style`, which Datastar drops the first time `!show` reveals it — the reveal clears the inline property rather than restoring what was there. Put the `display` in a class and leave the inline one to `initially`.
  --> tests/ui/show_with_its_own_display.rs:14:39
   |
14 |             div style="display:flex" !show(signal_open, initially: false) { "Panel" }
   |                                       ^^^^

error: this element writes `display` in its own `style`, which Datastar drops the first time `!show` reveals it — the reveal clears the inline property rather than restoring what was there. Put the `display` in a class and leave the inline one to `initially`.
  --> tests/ui/show_with_its_own_display.rs:15:39
